# EAS upload exclusions — keep the tarball small.
# This file is read by eas-cli from the git repo root. Files listed here are
# stripped from the EAS Build upload after git clone.

# --- Unrelated workspaces sitting in this repo ---
# `ruflo/` is a separate project with its own .git (667 MB).
ruflo/
# `apps/mobile-fresh/` is the old scrapped React Native project; ~380 MB of
# committed Android build artifacts that aren't needed for the live app.
apps/mobile-fresh/

# --- Compiled artifacts that shouldn't ride along ---
*.aab
*.apk
*.ipa
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/Pods/
**/DerivedData/
**/.expo/
**/dist/

# --- Local config + caches ---
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/node_modules/
**/.turbo/
**/coverage/
**/.next/
**/.cache/
